## 3. C# (.NET)

```csharp
using System;
using System.IO;
using System.Collections.Generic;

class Program
{
    static void Main()
    {
        // 1️⃣  All lines into a string[]
        string[] lines = File.ReadAllLines("myfile.txt");

        // 2️⃣  Or, read lazily with IEnumerable<string>
        IEnumerable<string> lazyLines = File.ReadLines("myfile.txt");
        foreach (var line in lazyLines)
        {
            Console.WriteLine(line);
        }
    }
}
```

`ReadAllLines` loads the whole file into memory; `ReadLines` streams it.

