## 8. Bash (shell)

```bash
# Read all lines into an array (Bash 4+)
mapfile -t lines < myfile.txt   # lines[0] is first line, no newline

# Or, process line by line
while IFS= read -r line; do
    echo "$line"
done < myfile.txt
```

