## General Tips

| Situation | Recommended Approach | Why |
|-----------|----------------------|-----|
| **Small file** | Read all lines into memory (`readlines()`, `readAllLines`, `File.ReadAllLines`, etc.) | Simpler code, fast access |
| **Large file** | Stream / lazy read (`readlines()` with a loop, `Files.lines()`, `File.ReadLines()`, `bufio.Scanner`, etc.) | Avoids OOM, lower memory footprint |
| **Need to strip newlines** | Use `rstrip('\n')`, `trim()`, `line.rstrip('\n')`, `scanner.Text()`, etc. | Clean data |
| **Unicode / encoding** | Specify encoding (`utf-8`, `StandardCharsets.UTF_8`, etc.) | Prevent garbled text |
| **Error handling** | Wrap in try/catch or check `err` | Robustness |

